cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this code, cite CASSIE and the Godot module it is vendored from.
title: CASSIE Godot module, sketch graph (vendored)
abstract: >-
  modules/cassie/src/sketch/cassie_sketch_graph.{h,cpp} of the org's Godot
  fork at a4e33d895f, unedited: CassieSketchGraph, the port of CASSIE's
  CycleDetection.cs (add_stroke merging nearby endpoints into shared nodes,
  find_cycles). tools/vendor/cassie_graph_subset.sh reproduces it.
  cassie_graph.elf runs it the way the module's pipeline bench
  (tests/test_cassie_pipeline_bench.h, _probe_curves_file) does.
authors:
  - name: V-Sekai-fire
repository-code: https://github.com/V-Sekai-fire/entities-godot
commit: a4e33d895f
license: MIT
references:
